      "name": "caffeinate-claude",
      "source": "./plugins/caffeinate-claude",
      "description": "Keeps your Mac awake during Claude Code sessions using macOS caffeinate. Supports multiple tabs, handles crashes gracefully with a 1-hour safety timeout, and cleans up automatically when all sessions end.",
